reports.text:
CITI on Infosys ; Neutral, TP Rs 1105

Largely inline 2Q on revenues/EBIT; deal TCV at $5b+ was strong.
Forward looking indicators –
(a) Organic guidance now implies -0.2% yoy at the mid-point, vs +0.6% post 1Q and +2.3% yoy at start of FY;
(b) TTM TCV +41% yoy;
(c) Headcount flattish yoy;
(d) Mgmt commentary – good deal TCV & AI growth positive; client spending cautious

FY27E/FY28E EPS revised marginally by 0-1%

New mega deal should address some concerns around Infy starting FY28 at a disadvantage relative to peers, after the loss in a European mfg. client.
